<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Quantum an outperform.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Quantum an outperform.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Smith Barney started coverage of Quantum Corp with an outperform, a source at the brokerage said on Thursday.</p>
<p>-- Quantum shares gained one to 37-3/8 in early Nasdaq trade.</p>
</text>
